{"id":"9f58a86df6a002bd203577a0c9c047ac2ac6b5ac","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243736","title":"想用 Siri AI，正在考虑把 iCloud 账号转到哪个区更好？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Arispex","excerpt":"Apple - @Arispex - Siri AI 必须登外区的 iCloud 账号，考虑过港区，但是发现港区的订阅服务实在太贵了，美区拼车会更好？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111865\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 20:07:57 +08:00\">22h 16m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>siri ai 真的没用，不用浪费时间瞎折腾</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111993\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/99c3/98be/68817_normal.png?m=1758263712\" alt=\"hiapk\" data-uid=\"68817\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hiapk\">hiapk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 21:03:14 +08:00\">21h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Siri AI 目前还是很 beta 的·····别折腾</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112060\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d809604ef11ed53ed43baab585b7f20a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MacsedProtoss\" data-uid=\"563187\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</